            <div xml:id="d11">

                <pb facs="0104" n="11" sameAs="frus:frus1935v04/pg11"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">724.3415/4562: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Paraguay</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Thurston</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Asunción</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1935-02-23T18:00:00-04:00">February 23, 1935—6
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 7:45 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>14. My telegram No. 12, February 21, 3 p.m. I have just been informed by
                    telephone by the Foreign Office that a communication has been transmitted to the
                    League announcing Paraguay’s withdrawal.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Thurston</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
